    <string name="privacy_text">Akhu has no ads and does not sell your data.\n\nON YOUR PHONE\nWallpapers, themes and edits you make are kept on your phone. The check that keeps explicit pictures out of public posts runs on your phone, and your pictures are not sent anywhere for it.\n\nYOUR ACCOUNT\nIf you sign in, your email address and display name are kept by Firebase Authentication (Google) so you can sign in again.\n\nPOSTS\nWallpapers you post are stored with Firebase (Google) together with your display name, the title and tags you give them, and their likes. Public posts can be seen by everyone using Akhu. Private ones can only be seen by you.\n\nQUESTIONS\nTo have your account or posts removed, contact us from Settings.</string>
